  unitName: Isengrim Angler Faelan
  unitId: 820898
  unitNumber: 8623
  description: "Deep within the frigid forests of the Frozen Mountains, the Northern
    Isengrim tribe of wulfs roam their snowy home in service and protection of the
    divine spirit known as Forest Mother. Appearing as little more than children
    with wolfish features, these proud warriors take their legacy seriously, for
    they are the descendants of the White Wulf God, Fenrir. As such, it is a tribal
    tradition for even young pups to undertake hunts on their own, to better prove
    their might and eligibility to become the next White Wulf of their tribe\u2014a
    title befitting only the most heroic warrior of a hundred years.Now, the time
    has come for one stout-hearted pup to shine. Though only a juvenile, nothing
    scares the brave wulf Faelan; not the bitter cold of the endless blizzard, nor
    the howling snowstorms that threaten to lay great pines low. No, she will hunt
    the beast of the frozen lake and claim its head, and surely the village will
    recognize her as the next White Wulf!Armed with her fishing rod and her hand-carved
    hook, the young pup heads off for the hunt of her lifetime, unaware of what fate
    had in store for her that day. After all, no one sets out expecting to deal with
    very different sorts of beasts in a decidedly un-snowy locale. Who would have
    thought that strange, shimmering portal was more than a curiosity and would take
    her to a dense jungle with abundant\u2014and delicious\u2014prey?Nevertheless,
    the beast in the frozen lake back home could certainly wait in its silty slumber.
    For now, there was the matter of getting home\u2014along with a strange, snivelling
    little cat-girl with horns she'd stumbled upon..."
  summonDesc: Awoo!<br>A-hunting we will go!<br>No brave Wulf will back down from
    a challenge!
  fusionDesc: A growing pup needs lots of calcium!<br>...<br>Can...Can I have more
    bones?
  evoDesc: New lures! New hat!<br>New... Cat?<br>Where did that come from?
  element: 2
  rarity: 7
